## Local Events discovery

Discovery should be **comprehensive**; ranking should be **editorial**.

| Concern | Location |
| --- | --- |
| Multi-strategy gather | `localEvents/searchStrategies.ts` |
| Kindred Editorial Score | `localEvents/editorialScore.ts` |
| Rank + allocate | `localEvents/ranking.ts`, `horizonAllocator.ts` |
| Candidate cap | `SERPAPI_CANDIDATE_CAP = 200` (retrieval only) |

Experiences (concerts, festivals, markets, comedy) rank above networking and
ordinary business listings. Discover everything; publish what passes the
editorial test.
